 "remarks": "Welcome to 28 Crooked Mile Road! Privately sited at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac in North Darien on a private road in the Ox Ridge school district, this handsome cedar shingle-clad colonial sits on two beautifully manicured acres with mature trees and planting beds. The property offers wonderful western and southern exposure, the house is truly flooded with sunshine throughout the day. The home underwent a major renovation in 2007 and more recently, in 2020, the kitchen and bar area had a fabulous redo!. The classic shaker style kitchen shares an adjacent family room with a fireplace and access to the patio beyond. Formal living and dining rooms and an office anchor the first floor, along with a magazine worthy, newly renovated sunroom (complete with wet bar)! The second floor holds 5 bedrooms. Four are en-suite and positioned along the south side of the house, while a 5th (and potential 6th) bedroom sit on the North side - well suited for guests, older children or an au pair. Also, up the back stairs, is a generous bonus room, perfect for any number of activities! In 2025 the entire roof was replaced, and an array of solar panels were installed on the rear of the home. An electric car charger in the 3-car garage and generator complete this very well-equipped house. Don't miss the chance to make this well maintained and beautifully updated colonial your forever home!",
